### Calendar Management Test

### 1. Lấy dữ liệu calendar theo tháng (Admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings/calendar?viewType=monthly&startDate=2024-02-01&endDate=2024-02-29
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJfaWQiOiI2ODdjNjYyYmY5MzVkNDY3YThhNGI2Y2IiLCJlbWFpbCI6ImFkbWluQHZpbmFzaWRlLmNvbSIsIm5hbWUiOiJhZG1pbiIsInJvbGUiOiJhZG1pbiIsImN1c3RvbVJvbGVzIjpbXSwiaXNzIjoiYXBpIiwiaWF0IjoxNzU0NTczNDA4LCJleHAiOjE3NTUxNzgyMDh9.zq1lGjGdTSdgb2M862u4K_WuIjL0yivIZj1cZPpqkp4
Content-Type: application/json

### 2. Lấy dữ liệu calendar theo tuần (Staff)
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings/calendar?viewType=weekly&startDate=2024-02-12&endDate=2024-02-18&propertyId={{propertyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 3. Lấy dữ liệu calendar theo ngày (Staff)
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings/calendar?viewType=daily&startDate=2024-02-15&endDate=2024-02-15&listingId={{listingId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 4. Lấy thông tin booking chi tiết cho một ngày cụ thể
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings/calendar/day/2024-02-15?propertyId={{propertyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 5. Lấy thông tin booking cho một listing cụ thể trong ngày
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings/calendar/day/2024-02-15?listingId={{listingId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 6. Filter theo status
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings/calendar?viewType=monthly&status=confirmed&payment_status=paid
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 7. Calendar cho admin quản lý nhiều homestay
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings/calendar?viewType=monthly&startDate=2024-02-01&endDate=2024-02-29
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 8. Calendar cho staff quản lý property được assign
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings/calendar?viewType=weekly&propertyId={{propertyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: application/json 